  "description": "The Megatron 5.0 is the step-thru version of Rambo's all-wheel-drive hunting bike. Easy on, easy off, with on-demand AWD for mud, snow, grass, and hills.\n\nStep-thru frame in 6061-T6 aluminum. Easy on, easy off. 350 lb capacity. 86 lb with the battery removed.\n\nDual 52V 1000W motors, on-demand all-wheel drive.\n52V 25Ah battery\n\nUp to 38 mph with adjustable pedal assist and a right-thumb throttle\n\nSingle speed with a 30T custom rear sprocket, geared for mid-range speed. No derailleur to maintain.\nRambo 26 x 4.0 tires with 5mm anti-puncture protection\nRambo 860 brakes\nUpdated LCD with Bluetooth so you can set each assist level from the phone app\nGreen and white light\n\nColors: Flat Dark Earth (FDE) and TrueTimber Viper Western Camo.",
